# 统一按 LF 检出：迁移 SQL 会被 include_str! 编进二进制并参与 sqlx 校验和计算，
# Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会把它改成 CRLF，导致「migration was previously applied
# but has been modified」启动崩溃。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dmp binary
